window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Best-selling author Stephanie Laurens begins a promising new series that blends romance and mystery. </p> <p>Penelope Ashford, Portia Cynster's younger sister, has devoted her life to the care of orphans. But lately, her charges seem to be disappearing without a trace. Penelope enlists investigator Barnaby Adair to solve the mystery. Adair agrees, intrigued by both the case and by Penelope.</p>"; 
